    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3082\u79C1\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3001\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3092\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u306E\u3060\u3051\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though it\u0027s not for me\u2014\nI\u0027d like you to help Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5FEB\u8AFE\u3059\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Accept eagerly"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306B\u4EFB\u305B\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course!\nLeave it to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u306B\uFF1F\n\u52A9\u304B\u308B\u308F\uFF5E\u3001\u3055\u3059\u304C\u30DE\u30EB\u30ED\u30FC\u30CD\u3055\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?\nThat\u0027s wonderful~ I knew I could count on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u56F0\u3063\u305F\u3068\u304D\u306F\u304A\u4E92\u3044\u3055\u307E\u3067\u3059\u3057\u3001\n\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u3082\u4F7F\u308F\u305B\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We help each other out when needed,\nand I\u0027ve been using your atelier too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306B\u306F\n\u6069\u8FD4\u3057\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need to repay you for all the help\nyou\u0027ve given me, Saskia!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3001\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u308F\u306D\u3002\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3001\u306A\u3067\u306A\u3067\u304F\u3089\u3044\u3057\u304B\n\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u308F\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, aren\u0027t you sweet.\nThough all I can offer in return\nis a few head pats."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3001\u306A\u3067\u306A\u3067\u306F\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no head pats needed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u3054\u8912\u7F8E\u3092\u306D\u3060\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ask for a reward"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01\n\u305D\u306E\u4EE3\u308F\u308A\u3001\u4F55\u304B\u3054\u8912\u7F8E\u304C\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u306A\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure thing!\nBut I want a reward in return~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3063\u304B\u308A\u3057\u3066\u308B\u308F\u306D\u3047\u3002\n\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3001\u7D42\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3054\u8912\u7F8E\u306B\n\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3044\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u3092\u3054\u99B3\u8D70\u3057\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308B\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aren\u0027t you clever.\nAlright, when you\u0027re done, I\u0027ll treat you\nto some delicious sweets as a reward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u3084\u3063\u305F\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? Yay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u306E\u4EE3\u308F\u308A\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3057\u3066\u306D\uFF1F\n\u3069\u3053\u304B\u3067\u3055\u307C\u3063\u305F\u308A\u306A\u3093\u304B\u3057\u305F\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But in return, you have to help properly, okay?\nIf I catch you slacking off..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3001\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059\u3063\u3066\u3002\n\u3054\u8912\u7F8E\u304C\u51FA\u308B\u306A\u3089\u624B\u629C\u304D\u306A\u3093\u304B\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-don\u0027t worry!\nIf there\u0027s a reward, I won\u0027t cut any corners!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u73FE\u91D1\u306A\u5B50\u306D\u3047",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Such a mercenary little thing~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9762\u5012\u304F\u3055\u304C\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Act reluctant"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3047\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5E74\u672B\u5E74\u59CB\u306F\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u305F\u3044\n\u306A\u3042\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, I was kind of hoping to take it easy\nover the New Year..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3088\u306D\uFF5E\u3002\u3067\u304D\u308C\u3070\u3053\u3093\u306A\u9762\u5012\u306A\u3053\u3068\n\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\u304A\u304D\u305F\u3044\u308F\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know~ It would be nice not to have\nto deal with troublesome things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3051\u3069\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3053\u305D\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u3066\u308B\u306E\u3088\u3002\n\u304A\u9858\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306A\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But that\u0027s exactly why I\u0027m asking.\nPlease! It\u0027s for Resna\u0027s sake."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3041\u2026\u2026\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u3044\u3046\u306A\u3089\n\u4ED5\u65B9\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... if you insist that much,\nI guess I have no choice. I\u0027ll help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u52A9\u304B\u308B\u308F\u3001\u30DE\u30EB\u30ED\u30FC\u30CD\u3055\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would be a great help, Miss Marlone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u3053\u307E\u3067\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u304C\u5927\u5909\u306A\u3089\n\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u3042\u3052\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306E\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if Resna\u0027s having such a hard time,\ncouldn\u0027t you help her yourself?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u79C1\u3067\u3001\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u914D\u308A\u306B\n\u884C\u3053\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have my own task\u2014\nI\u0027m planning to hand out charms."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u5E74\u3082\u8272\u3093\u306A\u4EBA\u3068\u77E5\u308A\u5408\u3063\u305F\u308F\u3002\n\u6765\u5E74\u306E\u5E74\u59CB\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u3081\u308B\u3068\u9045\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\n\u305D\u3046\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u4ECA\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u3081\u3088\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027ve met so many people this year.\nIf I wait until New Year\u0027s, it\u0027ll be too late,\nso I want to start now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u6025\u304C\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to rush"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u6025\u304C\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u3002\n\u5C11\u3057\u304F\u3089\u3044\u5E74\u59CB\u304B\u3089\u9045\u308C\u305F\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u6C17\u306B\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There\u0027s no need to rush.\nI\u0027m sure no one would mind if you\u0027re\na little late after New Year\u0027s!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u6975\u591C\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u3068\u306E\n\u6C7A\u6226\u306B\u6311\u3082\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\n\u305D\u306E\u524D\u306B\u6E21\u3057\u3066\u304A\u304D\u305F\u3044\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3046\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we\u0027re about to face our final battle\nwith the Polar Night Alchemists, aren\u0027t we?\nI want to give these out before then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u304C\u7121\u4E8B\u306B\u65B0\u5E74\u3092\u8FCE\u3048\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So everyone can safely welcome the new year."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6E96\u5099\u4E07\u7AEF\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re well-prepared!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u3001\u6E96\u5099\u4E07\u7AEF\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u3053\u3046\u3044\u3046\u306E\u3001\u9762\u5012\u304F\u3055\u304C\u3063\u3066\u52D5\u304B\u306A\u3044\n\u5370\u8C61\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, you\u0027re really well-prepared!\nI always thought you were the type to\nput things off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3001\u79C1\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3084\u308B\u3068\u304D\u306F\u3084\u308B\u306E\u3088\uFF1F\n\u59CB\u3081\u308C\u3070\u65E9\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, even I can be proactive when I want to be!\nOnce I start something, I move quickly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u8AB0\u3082\u65E9\u304F\u52D5\u3044\u3066\u3082\u307B\u3081\u3066\n\u304F\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3082\u306E\u3002\n\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3044\u3064\u3082\u306F\u3086\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u3066\u308B\u306E\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But nobody praises you for getting an early start,\nso that\u0027s why I usually take my time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3042\u305F\u3057\u304C\u307B\u3081\u3066\u3042\u3052\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I\u0027ll praise you today!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3042\u3089\u3002\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3088\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u3067\u306A\u3067\u3057\u3066\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, my. Would you like a pat on the head?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3067\u306A\u3067\u306F\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No head pats!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u306E\u306F\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306A\u306E\u3067\u306F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe Saskia\u0027s the one who needs help"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u306E\u306F\n\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306A\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be that you\u0027re actually\nthe one who needs help, Saskia?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\u3088\u3002\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u306E\u4EBA\u306B\u914D\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\n\u3042\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\u672C\u5F53\u306F\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\n\u3060\u3051\u308C\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right. I need to distribute these to many people,\nso I could really use some help..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u79C1\u306A\u3093\u304B\u3088\u308A\u4ECA\u306F\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3092\n\u624B\u4F1D\u3063\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But please help Resna instead of me\nfor now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3001\u307E\u305A\u306F\u304A\u5B88\u308A\u3092\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\n\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3066\u3053\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3002\n\u307E\u305F\u306D\u3001\u30DE\u30EB\u30ED\u30FC\u30CD\u3055\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I should go prepare lots of charms.\nSee you later, Miss Marlone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5E74\u672B\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u3063\u3066\n\u3000\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u307F\u3093\u306A\u5FD9\u3057\u305D\u3046\u306B\u3057\u3066\u308B\u306A\u3042\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(With the year ending,\neveryone seems so busy...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u304C\u5FD9\u3057\u304F\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u3000\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u5FC3\u914D\u3057\u3066\u6C17\u306B\u304B\u3051\u3066\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even though she\u0027s busy herself,\nSaskia\u0027s still worried about Resna.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3044\u3044\u5E2B\u5320\u3060\u306A\u3042\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She\u0027s such a good mentor.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3082\u3046\u3044\u304F\u3064\u5BDD\u308B\u3068\u65B0\u5E74\u306D\u3002\n\u3000\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u3060\u3057\u3001\u65B0\u5E74\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3067\n\u3000\u8857\u3092\u6B69\u3053\u3046\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Just a few more nights until the new year.\nMaybe I\u0027ll walk around town\nin my New Year\u0027s outfit.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]